NOT A SAFETY TOOL. USE AT YOUR OWN RISK. PowderMeet is a hobby project. Its
maps, routes, run difficulties, lift and run status, snow and weather
conditions, arrival times and meeting points come from community and third-
party data and automated processing. They may be incomplete, out of date or
wrong, and nothing in the app is checked for safety. Do not rely on PowderMeet
to decide where it is safe to ski or ride. Always obey the resort's signs,
closures, trail ratings and ski patrol, stay within your ability, and use your
own judgment. Skiing and snowboarding are dangerous. To the fullest extent
permitted by law, the copyright holder accepts no liability for any injury,
death, loss or damage arising from the use of PowderMeet or its data.
